很多</text><text for="L38">以前的我是一个孤独的灵魂 但那也只是曾经</text><text for="L39">自从你理解我之后我觉得好了很多</text><text for="L40">我是一个孤独的灵魂 但那是以前的我</text><text for="L41">你使我变得聪明了一点</text><text for="L42">又回到当初的感觉</text><text for="L43">回到当初的感觉</text></translation></translations></iTunesMetadata></metadata></head><body><div itunes:song-part="Verse"><p begin="0:15.249" end="0:18.312" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:15.249" end="0:15.564">It's</span> <span begin="0:15.564" end="0:15.812">been</span> <span begin="0:15.812" end="0:16.064">a</span> <span begin="0:16.064" end="0:16.249">long</span> <span begin="0:16.249" end="0:16.436">time</span> <span begin="0:16.436" end="0:16.689">coming</span> <span begin="0:16.689" end="0:16.936">since</span> <span begin="0:16.936" end="0:17.249">I've</span> <span begin="0:17.249" end="0:17.564">seen</span> <span begin="0:17.564" end="0:17.937">your</span> <span begin="0:17.937" end="0:18.312">face</span></p><p begin="0:18.559" end="0:25.865" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:18.559" end="0:19.055">And</span> <span begin="0:19.055" end="0:19.241">I've</span> <span begin="0:19.241" end="0:19.492">never</span> <span begin="0:19.492" end="0:19.925">went</span> <span begin="0:19.925" end="0:20.429">back</span> <span begin="0:20.429" end="0:20.805">trying</span> <span begin="0:20.805" end="0:21.240">to</span> <span begin="0:21.240" end="0:21.991">replace</span> <span begin="0:21.991" end="0:22.366">everything</span> <span begin="0:22.366" end="0:22.991">that</span> <span begin="0:22.991" end="0:23.425">I've</span> <span begin="0:23.425" end="0:23.805">had</span> <span begin="0:23.805" end="0:24.182">till</span> <span begin="0:24.182" end="0:24.555">my</span> <span begin="0:24.555" end="0:24.866">feet</span> <span begin="0:24.866" end="0:25.175">went</span> <span begin="0:25.175" end="0:25.865">numb</span></p><p begin="0:25.865" end="0:29.552" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:25.865" end="0:26.300">Praying</span> <span begin="